# Files kept out of the image build context: the build needs the Go sources, public/ and go.mod, nothing else.
# Build inputs that are never copied into an image layer:
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
# Documentation and repository metadata (the page's own docs are in public/).
*.md
.gitignore
# Environment files can hold secrets; a context must never carry them.
.env*
# Build and release tooling that runs outside the image.
Makefile
.github/
LICENSE
CHANGELOG.md
# The root llms.txt describes the repository; the image ships public/llms.txt for the running server.
llms.txt
# Tests are not built into the binary and would only enlarge the context.
*_test.go
